╰┈➤ MySQL Stored Procedures — From Scratch to Real-Time Production
A Stored Procedure is a named program stored inside the MySQL server that can accept inputs, execute multiple SQL statements 
and control-flow logic, modify data, manage transactions, and return result sets or values through parameters

1. First Understand the Problem
Imagine we are building a Zepto/Instamart-style quick-commerce system
